# Select the `local` or `docker` environment in Rider's "Run with" menu.
# The token must belong to an administrator.
@apiToken = {{OFFICEDAYS_TOKEN}}

### Create Romania as a holiday jurisdiction
# The AddHolidayJurisdictions migration already seeds RO for upgraded and fresh databases,
# so this request normally returns 409 Conflict. It is included as an explicit setup request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/holiday-jurisdictions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "RO",
  "name": "Romania"
}

### Ensure the existing RO jurisdiction has the desired display name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/holiday-jurisdictions/RO
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Romania"
}

### Replace Romania's complete 2026 bank-holiday calendar
# 1 June is both Children's Day and Orthodox Whit Monday, so it is represented once.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-holidays/RO/2026
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "date": "2026-01-01", "name": "Anul Nou" },
  { "date": "2026-01-02", "name": "A doua zi după Anul Nou" },
  { "date": "2026-01-06", "name": "Boboteaza" },
  { "date": "2026-01-07", "name": "Sfântul Ioan Botezătorul" },
  { "date": "2026-01-24", "name": "Ziua Unirii Principatelor Române" },
  { "date": "2026-04-10", "name": "Vinerea Mare" },
  { "date": "2026-04-12", "name": "Paștele Ortodox" },
  { "date": "2026-04-13", "name": "A doua zi de Paște" },
  { "date": "2026-05-01", "name": "Ziua Muncii" },
  { "date": "2026-05-31", "name": "Prima zi de Rusalii" },
  { "date": "2026-06-01", "name": "Ziua Copilului / A doua zi de Rusalii" },
  { "date": "2026-08-15", "name": "Adormirea Maicii Domnului" },
  { "date": "2026-11-30", "name": "Sfântul Andrei" },
  { "date": "2026-12-01", "name": "Ziua Națională a României" },
  { "date": "2026-12-25", "name": "Crăciunul" },
  { "date": "2026-12-26", "name": "A doua zi de Crăciun" }
]

### Verify Romania's configured 2026 holidays (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-holidays/RO/2026
Accept: application/json
